# services/agent/.dockerignore
#
# The root .dockerignore does NOT apply to this image: Docker reads
# <context>/.dockerignore and this service is built with
# `build: ./services/agent`. Without this file the context included
# services/agent/.venv, several hundred megabytes of host-built virtualenv.
#
# NOTE THE ABSENCE OF `data`. data/course_index.json is a runtime artifact, not
# a build leftover — the RAG layer reads it and the image COPYs it. Excluding it
# makes the tutor silently stop retrieving from the course. See the header of
# this service's Dockerfile.
#
# SECURITY: the .env rules keep credentials out of image layers, which stay
# readable via `docker history` / `docker save`. Secrets are run-time only.

.venv
venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

tests
docs
*.md
railway.json
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
